          where

          :math:`D_{out} = D_{in} + \text{padding\_front} + \text{padding\_back}`

          :math:`H_{out} = H_{in} + \text{padding\_top} + \text{padding\_bottom}`

          :math:`W_{out} = W_{in} + \text{padding\_left} + \text{padding\_right}`

